nts 200..\n# ANSWER \u2014 from the grown structure only; the truth stays outside (Alpha 2's belief-scope law)\nRECALL k=1                           # light one side as a moment does, read the strongest edge (G0 \u00a711 am. 6)\nABSTAIN second/best > 0.85           # \u00abI do not know this\u00bb when a COMPETITOR is too close (G0 \u00a711 am. 5); metacognition's first cell (F4)\n#\n# DECLARED, OFF IN THIS RUN \u2014 each is an estate organ with a proof; each gets its own run, one at a time (PREREG \u00a71b):\nGAZE   surprise fixations 4 grid 16 canvas 128 glance 32 ink border     # GAZE GENE ON (G1 \u00a71): Alpha 2 organs/retina.py + organs/gaze.py (V0.1, d772bf7, 2026-09-05) imported VERBATIM,\n                                     #   sha-pinned in genome/gaze.py; fixation 1 = the saliency peak, then the most surprising unvisited cell (residual saliency on a\n                                     #   first frame), inhibition of return, 4 per picture (12 was per page frame); a glance = a 32\u00d732 window on the fixated cell; INK (\u00a76 am. 1) =\n                                     #   |grey \u2212 median of the window's 2-px rim| / max (\u00a76 amendment 1; the first run's |grey \u2212 mean| rule made filled shapes one shape); each glance is one moment with the same word. Proof: V0.1's 12 regions vs the random twin's 3\u20134.\n#OFF EAR-SOUND cochlear gammatone agc      # E52's cochlear front (Alpha 3, 09-17): the first hearing gate PASS at 1.000; its ablation says the loudness path carries \u2014 for the sound sense\n#OFF CONTEXT   family read-time            # D31 (Alpha 3, 09-16): the family as read-time context \u2014 digits 0.692 \u2192 0.792, handwritten 0.193 \u2192 0.660; here the WORD is the picture's context\n#OFF CURIOSITY interest-population         # Alpha 2 organs/curiosity_genome.py (L2, 09-01): content-free operators, beat its null twin every measurement (16,114.6 vs 2,223.3) \u2014 for when he chooses his own stream\n#OFF PREDICT   next-moment error           # his research (the AGI Q&A \u00a7predictive coding / active inference; R2): he says what comes next and files the miss \u2014 the error signal that closes no loop over his own records (F1)\n#OFF SENTENCE  compose under-judge         # Alpha 2 speech_v2 (L4, 09-02): sentences composed from his own record under a frozen judge, never next-token; his 09-12 12:38 \u00abspeaks as an organism\u00bb\n#OFF HANDS     jail landlock seccomp       # Alpha 2 core/jail (A2-R6), reused by Alpha 3's hands: the road to run what he writes; the open world (his 09-17 00:07)\n# gate G-a wrote THETA_N=0.955 THETA_M=0.9975 \u2014 G1 \u00a71: gate G-a on his glances found the bands OVERLAPPING (within-median 0.836 \u2264 floor 0.921); the TOY's thetas are carried so the run can read; the verdict says so\n", "state_hash": "4edfa98c301f507f74020bcb41d3f16b06426a251885086e8016cc0b94fa1a71"}